  static trainingQuestions():ToeicQuestion[] {
    return [
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PURPOSE-0701",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PURPOSE,"NOTICE\nStarting next Monday, the west lobby will close at 6 P.M. while new security gates are installed. Employees leaving after 6 P.M. should use the east exit until the work is completed on Thursday.","Why was the notice written?",["To announce a temporary exit change","To recruit security staff","To report a lost access card","To change office opening hours"],0,"通知核心是西侧大厅晚间关闭并改走东侧出口。","Employees leaving after 6 P.M. should use the east exit until the work is completed on Thursday.","temporary exit change = use the east exit during the work",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PURPOSE-0702",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PURPOSE,"Subject: Updated Expense Form\nPlease use the attached expense form for all travel completed after October 1. The previous form will no longer be accepted because the finance team has added a field for project codes.","What is the purpose of the e-mail?",["To introduce a revised form","To approve a travel request","To cancel a business trip","To explain a salary change"],0,"邮件要求以后使用新版报销表，核心是通知表单更新。","Please use the attached expense form for all travel completed after October 1.","updated form = revised form",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PURPOSE-0703",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PURPOSE,"GRAND OPENING\nHarbor Street Café opens this Saturday at 8 A.M. Show this advertisement before noon and receive a complimentary pastry with any beverage purchase.","Why was the advertisement published?",["To promote a new café","To announce a staff meeting","To request customer feedback","To explain a delivery delay"],0,"广告给出开业时间和促销优惠，目的是推广新店。","Harbor Street Café opens this Saturday at 8 A.M. Show this advertisement before noon and receive a complimentary pastry.","grand opening + complimentary pastry = promote a new café",55,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PURPOSE-0704",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PURPOSE,"To: Building Tenants\nThe water supply will be turned off from 9 A.M. to 11 A.M. on Wednesday so that a damaged pipe on the fourth floor can be replaced. We apologize for the inconvenience.","Why did the building manager send this message?",["To warn tenants about a service interruption","To advertise office space","To collect a maintenance fee","To schedule a fire drill"],0,"正文说明停水时段和维修原因，是服务中断提醒。","The water supply will be turned off from 9 A.M. to 11 A.M. on Wednesday.","water supply turned off = service interruption",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PURPOSE-0705",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PURPOSE,"MEMO\nBecause several clients have requested earlier appointments, the customer service desk will begin opening at 8:30 A.M. instead of 9 A.M. beginning November 3.","What is the purpose of the memo?",["To announce an earlier opening time","To close the customer service desk","To introduce a new product","To move client appointments online"],0,"核心变化是服务台提前半小时开放。","the customer service desk will begin opening at 8:30 A.M. instead of 9 A.M.","begin opening at 8:30 instead of 9 = earlier opening time",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PURPOSE-0706",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.MAIN_IDEA,"Dear Members,\nOur fitness center will replace all treadmills this weekend. The exercise room will therefore be unavailable Saturday and Sunday, but the pool and studio classes will operate normally.","What is the main purpose of the message?",["To explain a weekend room closure","To sell used exercise equipment","To cancel all weekend activities","To announce new membership fees"],0,"邮件围绕更换跑步机导致运动室周末关闭展开。","The exercise room will therefore be unavailable Saturday and Sunday.","room unavailable because equipment is replaced = weekend room closure",55,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DETAIL-0801",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"DELIVERY UPDATE\nOrder 5816 departed the regional warehouse at 7:45 A.M. It is expected at the King Street office between 2 P.M. and 4 P.M. A receptionist must sign for the package.","Who must sign for the package?",["A receptionist","A warehouse manager","The courier's supervisor","The customer who placed the order"],0,"题干关键词 sign，原文直接定位 receptionist must sign。","A receptionist must sign for the package.","must sign = required to provide a signature",45,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DETAIL-0802",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"Workshop Registration\nCheck-in begins at 8:15 A.M. in Room 204. The opening presentation starts at 9 A.M., and coffee will be available in the lobby from 8:30 A.M.","Where does check-in take place?",["Room 204","The lobby","The cafeteria","Room 209"],0,"定位 check-in，原文给出 Room 204。","Check-in begins at 8:15 A.M. in Room 204.","takes place in = is held in",40,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DETAIL-0803",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"Subject: Printer Repair\nThe technician will arrive on Friday at 10:30 A.M. Please leave the third-floor copy room unlocked. Repairs are expected to take about ninety minutes.","What should employees do before the technician arrives?",["Leave the copy room unlocked","Move the printer downstairs","Print all documents Thursday","Call the technician directly"],0,"题目问到达前的动作，定位 Please leave...unlocked。","Please leave the third-floor copy room unlocked.","leave unlocked = make sure it is not locked",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DETAIL-0804",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"RETURN POLICY\nUnused items may be returned within 30 days with the original receipt. Clearance items are final sale and cannot be returned. Refunds are issued to the original form of payment.","Which item cannot be returned?",["A clearance item","An unused regular-price item","An item returned with a receipt","An item purchased less than 30 days ago"],0,"原文唯一排除项是 clearance items。","Clearance items are final sale and cannot be returned.","final sale = cannot be returned",45,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DETAIL-0805",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"Conference Schedule\n10:00 Keynote — Hall A\n11:15 Product Demo — Hall C\n1:30 Customer Panel — Hall B\n3:00 Closing Remarks — Hall A","Where is the customer panel scheduled?",["Hall A","Hall B","Hall C","The main lobby"],1,"定位 Customer Panel，同行给出 Hall B。","1:30 Customer Panel — Hall B","scheduled in Hall B = takes place in Hall B",40,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DETAIL-0806",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"Parking Notice\nVisitors may park in Lot C after 9 A.M. Employees with monthly permits should continue using Lot A. Lot B is reserved for delivery vehicles until noon.","Who should use Lot A?",["Employees with monthly permits","Visitors arriving after 9 A.M.","Delivery drivers","All customers"],0,"定位 Lot A，原文限定 monthly permits employees。","Employees with monthly permits should continue using Lot A.","employees with monthly permits = permit holders",45,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PARA-0901",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PARAPHRASE,"Customers who renew their annual membership before October 31 will receive a 20 percent reduction on next year's fee.","What benefit is offered to customers who renew early?",["A discounted membership fee","A free training session","An extended contract","A cash refund"],0,"reduction on the fee 对应 discounted membership fee。","will receive a 20 percent reduction on next year's fee","reduction = discount",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PARA-0902",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PARAPHRASE,"The museum provides complimentary lockers near the main entrance for visitors carrying small bags.","What is available at no charge?",["Lockers","Admission tickets","Guided tours","Parking"],0,"complimentary 与 at no charge 同义。","The museum provides complimentary lockers near the main entrance.","complimentary = at no charge",45,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PARA-0903",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PARAPHRASE,"The supplier expects the replacement units to reach our warehouse no later than Friday afternoon.","When should the units arrive?",["By Friday afternoon","After the weekend","Before Thursday morning","Exactly at noon Friday"],0,"no later than Friday afternoon 对应 by Friday afternoon。","to reach our warehouse no later than Friday afternoon","no later than = by",50,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PARA-0904",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.VOCAB_IN_CONTEXT,"All conference participants are encouraged to retain their name badges because they will be required for entry to the afternoon workshops.","What does 'retain' most nearly mean?",["Keep","Replace","Display publicly","Return immediately"],0,"retain 在此处表示继续保留名牌。","participants are encouraged to retain their name badges","retain = keep",45,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PARA-0905",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PARAPHRASE,"The repair company will waive the inspection charge for customers who approve the recommended service on the same day.","What will qualifying customers not have to pay?",["The inspection fee","The cost of replacement parts","A delivery charge","The annual membership"],0,"waive a charge 表示免除费用。","will waive the inspection charge","waive a charge = not require payment",55,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-PARA-0906",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.PARAPHRASE,"Applicants must submit all supporting documents prior to the deadline shown on the application portal.","When must the documents be sent?",["Before the listed deadline","On the interview date","After receiving an offer","Within one month of employment"],0,"prior to 与 before 同义。","submit all supporting documents prior to the deadline","prior to = before",45,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-LONG-1001",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.MAIN_STRUCTURE,"Although the renovation, which was originally scheduled to finish in September, has taken longer than expected, the branch will reopen on October 12 after a final safety inspection is completed.","What is the sentence mainly saying?",["The branch will reopen on October 12","The renovation started in September","The safety inspection was canceled","The branch moved to another building"],0,"先跳过 Although 从句和 which 插入说明，主干是 the branch will reopen on October 12。","the branch will reopen on October 12","main clause carries the key action",65,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-LONG-1002",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"Employees who have completed the online security course, which includes a short quiz at the end, may request a new building access card from Human Resources beginning Monday.","Who may request a new access card?",["Employees who completed the security course","All visitors to the building","Employees who failed the quiz","Only Human Resources staff"],0,"主语核心是 Employees who have completed the online security course。","Employees who have completed the online security course ... may request a new building access card.","completed the course = eligibility condition",65,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-LONG-1003",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.REFERENCE,"The shipment that arrived yesterday contains the replacement displays requested by the downtown store, and they will be transferred there after the inventory team records the serial numbers.","What does 'they' refer to?",["The replacement displays","The serial numbers","The inventory team","The downtown store"],0,"并列句中的 they 指向最近且语义匹配的复数名词 replacement displays。","contains the replacement displays ... and they will be transferred there","they = replacement displays",65,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-LONG-1004",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.INFERENCE,"Because the keynote speaker's flight was delayed, the presentation that had been planned for 9 A.M. will begin after the networking session, which ends at 10:30.","What can be inferred about the keynote presentation?",["It will start after 10:30","It will be canceled","It will begin before networking","It has moved to another day"],0,"networking session 10:30 结束，演讲在其后开始。","will begin after the networking session, which ends at 10:30","after a session ending 10:30 = after 10:30",70,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-LONG-1005",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.DETAIL,"The revised contract, which incorporates the pricing changes discussed during Tuesday's meeting, must be reviewed by the legal team before it can be sent to the client for signature.","What must happen before the contract is sent to the client?",["The legal team must review it","The client must change the price","Tuesday's meeting must be repeated","The contract must be printed"],0,"before it can be sent 前的主句动作是 legal team review。","must be reviewed by the legal team before it can be sent to the client","review precedes sending",65,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-LONG-1006",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.MAIN_STRUCTURE,"While customers whose orders were placed before noon will still receive same-day dispatch, orders submitted later will be processed the following business day because the warehouse now closes earlier.","What is the main contrast in the sentence?",["Orders before noon and later orders follow different schedules","All orders are delayed one week","The warehouse will stop accepting orders","Customers must collect packages themselves"],0,"while 引出对比：中午前订单当天发，之后订单次工作日处理。","orders placed before noon ... same-day dispatch; orders submitted later ... following business day","before noon versus later orders",70,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DOUBLE-1101",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — TRAIN SCHEDULE\nTrain 18: Northport 8:10 → Central 8:55\nTrain 24: Northport 8:40 → Central 9:25\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — MESSAGE\nMina, our client meeting at Central Plaza begins at 9:30. Please choose a train that leaves at least 20 minutes to walk from Central Station. —Eric","Which train should Mina take?",["Train 18","Train 24","Either train","Neither train"],0,"会议 9:30，步行至少20分钟，需要 9:10 前到站；只有 Train 18 在 8:55 到。","Train 18 arrives at 8:55; the message requires at least 20 minutes before 9:30.","cross-document time calculation",75,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DOUBLE-1102",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — HOTEL OFFER\nBook two nights before November 15 and receive complimentary airport transportation.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — E-MAIL\nI will stay at the Harbor Hotel from November 20 to November 22. I made the reservation on November 10. Please confirm whether I need to arrange a taxi. —Luis","What benefit should Luis receive?",["Free airport transportation","A third hotel night","A room upgrade","Free breakfast"],0,"预订日期 11/10 早于 11/15 且住两晚，满足免费机场交通条件。","Book two nights before November 15 and receive complimentary airport transportation; reservation made November 10.","complimentary transportation = free airport transportation",75,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DOUBLE-1103",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — RETURN POLICY\nElectronics may be returned within 14 days if unopened.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — RECEIPT\nPurchase: Wireless keyboard\nDate: October 2\n\nCustomer note dated October 18: The box is still sealed.","Why is the return likely to be refused?",["The 14-day period has passed","The box was opened","The item was discounted","A receipt is missing"],0,"10月2日至10月18超过14天，即使未开封也超出期限。","Electronics may be returned within 14 days; purchase October 2; note October 18.","within 14 days condition is not met",75,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DOUBLE-1104",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — SEMINAR PROGRAM\n10:00 Data Security\n11:30 Cloud Operations\n2:00 Product Strategy\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — NOTE\nI can attend only before noon, and I already completed the Data Security course last month. —Naomi","Which session is most appropriate for Naomi?",["Cloud Operations","Data Security","Product Strategy","None of the sessions"],0,"她只能中午前参加且已学过 Data Security，因此选择 11:30 Cloud Operations。","11:30 Cloud Operations; Naomi can attend only before noon and already completed Data Security.","combine schedule and participant constraint",75,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DOUBLE-1105",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — SHIPPING RATES\nStandard: $8, 3–5 business days\nExpress: $15, next business day\nFree standard shipping on orders over $100.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — ORDER\nSubtotal: $124\nCustomer request: Lowest possible delivery cost.","Which shipping option best matches the request?",["Free standard shipping","$8 standard shipping","$15 express shipping","Store pickup only"],0,"订单超过100美元，可享免费标准配送，且成本最低。","Free standard shipping on orders over $100; subtotal $124.","order qualifies for free standard shipping",75,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-DOUBLE-1106",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — OFFICE ACCESS\nTemporary badges are valid only on the date printed on them.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — BADGE\nVisitor: A. Singh\nValid: October 7\n\nE-mail dated October 8: I plan to return this afternoon for a second meeting.","What will A. Singh most likely need?",["A new temporary badge","The same badge from October 7","An employee parking permit","A building key"],0,"临时证只在印刷日期有效，10月8日再次进入需要新证。","Temporary badges are valid only on the date printed on them; badge valid October 7; return October 8.","date-limited badge requires replacement next day",75,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-TRIPLE-1201",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — CONFERENCE AGENDA\n8:30 Registration\n9:30 Opening Talk\n11:00 Workshop A\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — HOTEL SHUTTLE\nDepartures to Convention Center: 7:45, 8:30, 9:15. Travel time: 25 minutes.\n\nDOCUMENT 3 — MESSAGE\nKai, please arrive before registration closes at 9:15. Use the latest shuttle that still gets you there on time. —Nora","Which shuttle should Kai take?",["7:45","8:30","9:15","None"],1,"8:30 加25分钟=8:55，能在9:15前到；9:15班次太晚。","8:30 shuttle + 25 minutes = 8:55; arrive before 9:15.","latest feasible option across three documents",85,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-TRIPLE-1202",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — ORDER RECEIPT\nItem: Model Q Scanner\nOrder date: Oct. 3\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — WARRANTY\nModel Q may be replaced free of charge within 30 days if it fails under normal use.\n\nDOCUMENT 3 — SUPPORT NOTE dated Oct. 20\nCustomer reports that the scanner no longer powers on and shows no physical damage.","What is the customer most likely eligible for?",["A free replacement","A paid annual membership","A shipping surcharge","No assistance"],0,"故障发生在30天内且无物理损坏，符合免费更换条件。","Model Q may be replaced free of charge within 30 days; order Oct. 3; support note Oct. 20 with no physical damage.","within warranty period + normal-use failure",85,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-TRIPLE-1203",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — JOB POSTING\nApplicants must have two years of sales experience and be available to start November 1.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — RÉSUMÉ\nJordan Lee — Sales associate, 2023–present.\n\nDOCUMENT 3 — E-MAIL\nI can begin work on October 28 and am available full-time. —Jordan","Which requirement is least clearly satisfied?",["Two years of sales experience","Availability to start by November 1","Full-time availability","Ability to send e-mail"],0,"开始时间满足，但简历从2023至今未必已满两年，经验年限最不明确。","Posting requires two years of sales experience; résumé says 2023–present.","experience duration is not clearly two full years",90,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-TRIPLE-1204",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — COURSE LIST\nExcel Basics — Monday 9:00\nData Charts — Tuesday 14:00\nAdvanced Formulas — Thursday 10:00\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — PREREQUISITE\nAdvanced Formulas requires completion of Excel Basics.\n\nDOCUMENT 3 — NOTE\nPriya has never taken an Excel course and can attend only Monday or Thursday.","What should Priya take first?",["Excel Basics","Advanced Formulas","Data Charts","No course"],0,"Advanced Formulas 有前置要求；她周一可参加 Basics，应先完成基础课。","Advanced Formulas requires completion of Excel Basics; Priya can attend Monday or Thursday.","prerequisite determines first course",85,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-TRIPLE-1205",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — PARKING RATES\nGarage A: $12/day\nGarage B: $8/day\nGarage C: $5/day after 5 P.M.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — EVENT\nReception: Friday, 6 P.M.–8 P.M.\n\nDOCUMENT 3 — MESSAGE\nPlease choose the least expensive garage available for the whole reception. —Mark","Which garage best meets Mark's request?",["Garage A","Garage B","Garage C","All cost the same"],2,"活动6点开始，Garage C 5点后5美元，且最便宜。","Garage C: $5/day after 5 P.M.; reception begins at 6 P.M.","after 5 P.M. rate applies to the whole reception",80,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET),
      ToeicWeekTwoContent.q("R-P7-TRIPLE-1206",ToeicPart.PART_7,ToeicSkill.CROSS_DOCUMENT,"DOCUMENT 1 — LIBRARY HOURS\nWeekdays 8 A.M.–8 P.M.; Saturday 9 A.M.–5 P.M.\n\nDOCUMENT 2 — ROOM POLICY\nStudy rooms may be reserved for up to two hours and must end before closing.\n\nDOCUMENT 3 — REQUEST\nSaturday reservation requested from 4 P.M. to 6 P.M.","Why must the request be changed?",["The library closes at 5 P.M.","Rooms cannot be used Saturday","Reservations must be four hours","The library opens at noon"],0,"周六5点闭馆，申请到6点违反必须在闭馆前结束的规则。","Saturday 9 A.M.–5 P.M.; study rooms must end before closing; request 4 P.M.–6 P.M.","reservation extends past closing",80,ToeicDifficulty.MEDIUM,ToeicScoreValue.MUST_GET)
